    "allowedDebt": [
      "Bulwark is source/static configured from the pinned HotA Bulwark archive and generated runtime-asset manifest. Generated Core, installed payload, startup smoke, runtime behavior, and user-visible gameplay remain separate proof boundaries.",
      "Bulwark owns Permafrost (tile 30), a Snow presentation clone registered through the shared custom-biome pack. It must not share Tower's Tundra ownership or fall back to built-in Snow.",
      "Haugir is deliberately excluded because the HotA source marks him as water-map-only; Biarma is the source-defined non-water roster substitute.",
      "Material-class alternate upgrades deliberately inherit their corresponding HotA standard-upgrade stats until their own balance rows are authored; that inheritance is explicit in sourceStats rather than a generator fallback.",
      "All donor combat abilities/passives are cleared by the Bulwark ability override contract and generic unit normalize path. HotA-inspired baseline passives that map onto proven Olden Era GENERIC_* data mechanics (Snow/Steel Elf shooter role with no melee penalty and free shooting, Argali ice damage immunity) are wired through apply_release_core_overlay.py. Locked Focus remaps in ability_overrides/homm3_bulwark.json deliberately avoid Factory Focus donors and use Radiant Armor, Shorten Shadow, Blink, Ice Bolt, Shackles, Optical Illusion, Inquisitor dispel, Avalanche, and Arbitrator ally teleport (Clan Warp). Exact HotA-only leftovers or unproven add-ons: Kobold gold/day, Argali adjacent spell-damage aura (scaffold), Yeti all-negative one-round recovery + Runes possession (scaffold), Freezing Shot attack mutator exactness, War Mammoth defend-stance Defense multiplier (scaffold). Jotunn Frostbound Skies flyer Slow is source-wired; combat live-positive unproven.",
      "Runes is the only Bulwark faction mechanic delivered by this milestone. Generated-Core validation must prove the exact faction-skill row and player-facing text. Homm3BulwarkRunesRuntime is registered (Defend/Skip and other gain paths); per-stack Rune Levels, action gains, rank caps, cumulative thresholds, one counter per stack, and battle reset remain combat live-positive / PROOF.json debt.",
      "Every Bulwark standard and alternate upgrade keeps at least one Focus active; HotA passives are additive and must not strip upgrade actives."
    ]
  }
